hadiths[49]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1599","Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father that Abu Hurayra said"
"1600","Yahya related to me from Malik from Qatan ibn Wahb ibn Umayr ibn al-Ajda that Yuhannas"
"1601","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir from Jabir ibn Abdullah that a Bedouin took an oath of allegiance in Islam with the Messenger of Allah"
"1602","Malik related to me that Yahya ibn Said said"
"1603","Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1604","Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from Abdullah ibn az-Zubayr that Sufyan ibn Abi Zuhayr said"
"1605","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Himas from his paternal uncle from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1606","Malik related to me that he had heard that when Umar ibn Abd al- Aziz left Madina"
"1607","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amr"
"1608","Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Abu Hurayra said"
"1609","Malik related to me from Yunus ibn Yusuf from Ata ibn Yasar that Abu Ayyub al-Ansari found some boys who had driven a fox into a corner"
"1610","Yahya related to me from Malik from a man who said"
"1611","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that A'isha"
"1612","Malik said that Yahya ibn Said had related to him that A'isha said that Amir ibn Fuhayra had said at the time of the epidemic"
"1613","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nuaym ibn Abdullah al-Mujmir that Abu Hurayra said"
"1614","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ismail ibn Abi Hakim that he heard Umar ibn Abd al-Aziz say"
"1615","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that the Messenger of Allah"
"1616","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1617","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Abd ar- Rahman ibn al-Qasim that Aslam"
"1618","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abd al-Hamid ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Zayd ibn al-Khattab from Abdullah ibn Abdullah ibn al-Harith ibn Nawfal from Abdullah ibn Abbas that Umar ibn al- Khattab set out for ash Sham and when he was at Sargh"
"1619","Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir and from Salim ibn Abi'n-Nadr"
"1620","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Abdullah ibn Amir ibn Rabia that Umar ibn al-Khattab went out to ash-Sham. When he came to Sargh"
"1621","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Salim ibn Abdullah that Umar ibn al-Khattab turned people back at Sargh according to the hadith of Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf"
"1622","Yahya related to me that Malik said"
"1723","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"1724","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar cauterized for the palsy and he had a talisman made for a scorpion sting"
"1725","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from Fatima bint al-Mundhir that whenever a woman who had a fever"
"1726","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"1727","Malik related to me from Nafi from Ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1728","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard from Jabir ibn Abdullah that the Messenger of Allah"
"1729","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard from Bukayr ibn Abdullah ibn al-Ashajj from Ibn Atiya that the Messenger of Allah"
"1730","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Bakr ibn Nafi from his father Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"1731","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab that Humay ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Awf heard Muawiya ibn Abi Sufyan say from the mimbar in the year that he performed the hajj"
"1732","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ziyad ibn Sad heard Ibn Shihab say"
"1733","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar disapproved of castration and said"
"1734","Yahya related to me from Malik that Safwan ibn Sulaym heard that the Prophet"
"1735","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that Abu Qatada al-Ansari said to the Messenger of Allah"
"1736","Yahya related to me from Malik from Zayd ibn Aslam that Ata ibn Yasar told him that the Messenger of Allah"
"1737","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that Muhammad ibn Ibrahim at-Taymi had informed him that Abu Salama ibn Abd ar-Rahman said ""Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Aswad ibn Abdal-Yaghuth used to sit with us and he had a white beard and hair. One day he came to us and he had dyed them red"
"1738","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said that he had heard that Khalid ibn al-Walid said to the Messenger of Allah"
"1739","Yahya related to me from Malik that Yahya ibn Said said"
"1740","Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that a man of the Aslam tribe said"
"1741","Yahya related to me from Malik from Summayy"
"1742","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abd ar-Rahman ibn Mamar from Abu'l-Hubab Said ibn Yasar that Abu Hurayra said"
"1743","Yahya related to me from Malik from Khubayb ibn Abd ar-Rahman al- Ansari from Hafs ibn Asim that either Abu Said al-Khudri or Abu Hurayra said"
"1744","Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah"
"1745","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu Hazim ibn Dinar that Abu Idris al-Khawlani said"
"1746","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that Abdullah ibn Abbas said"
"1747","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ishaq ibn Abdullah ibn Abi Talha al-Ansari from Anas ibn Malik that the Messenger of Allah"